{"case_id": "female_19800921_P007-Q34", "domain": "annual_fortune", "question": "命主的两名小孩在哪一年出生？", "expected_answer": "D", "predicted_answer": "D", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字信息，日主丁火生于酉月，金旺火弱，喜木火为用。年柱庚申、月柱乙酉、日柱丁酉，时柱乙巳，时支巳火为日主之根，但整体金气过重，需木来生火。\n\n命主为女性，以食伤为子女星。丁火日主，食伤为土（戊己土）。八字中土星不显，但时支巳中藏戊土（伤官），月支酉中藏辛金（偏财），年支申中藏戊土（伤官）。子女星藏于地支，需大运流年引动。\n\n命主当前大运（假设40岁后）为壬午或癸未等，需看具体流年。2013年癸巳，巳火引动时支巳中戊土伤官，且癸水七杀（子女星之一）透干，但七杀为女命之子星，此年可能生男孩。2015年乙未，未土为食神（女命女儿星），且未中藏丁火、乙木，与命局乙木相合，此年可能生女孩。\n\n选项D为2013年男孩、2015年女孩，与上述分析吻合。其他选项年份或性别组合与命理引动不符。\n\n最终答案：D", "correct": true, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "female_19800921_P007-Q34", 1, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-v4flash-nt-20260805-r2\\dev\\2024_b1a_prime_1_g4\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 3472, "response_id": "26fa5083-93cf-4f12-a179-58cd5158152e", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 236, "completion_tokens": 297, "total_tokens": 533, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 108}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
{"case_id": "female_19800921_P007-Q35", "domain": "unknown", "question": "命主毕业后从事什么行业？", "expected_answer": "D", "predicted_answer": "A", "raw_answer": "根据八字命盘分析：\n\n日主丁火生于酉月，金旺火弱，但时支巳火为根，且有乙木偏印生身，属于身弱有印的格局。年柱庚申为正财，月柱乙酉偏印坐偏财，时柱乙巳偏印坐劫财。\n\n命局中财星（金）极旺，而印星（木）生身，显示命主有较强的学习能力和专业技能，但财旺身弱，容易为钱财奔波。丁火日主，性格外柔内刚，有服务精神。\n\n从十神组合看，偏印（乙木）透干，主学术、教育、文化类工作；同时财星旺，也可能涉及财务、商业。但偏印贴身，且时支巳火为禄神，更倾向于稳定、有知识性的职业。\n\n结合选项：\n- 中学教师（教育类，符合偏印特征）\n- 公司主管（管理类，需身强，但此命身弱，不太适合高压管理）\n- 房屋经纪（销售类，财旺但身弱，压力大，不太符合）\n- 会计（财务类，财星旺，但偏印主文，会计更偏正财和官星，此命偏印更明显）\n\n综合判断，偏印旺且贴身，最符合教育、文化行业，且女性丁火日主，教师职业较为常见。\n\n最终答案：A", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "female_19800921_P007-Q35", 1, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-v4flash-nt-20260805-r2\\dev\\2024_b1a_prime_1_g4\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 3850, "response_id": "90cc542f-2f4a-4804-80de-5323b9252d68", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 205, "completion_tokens": 307, "total_tokens": 512, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 77}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
{"case_id": "male_20070131_P008-Q36", "domain": "health", "question": "请问命主在一岁前被诊断出那一种疾病？", "expected_answer": "B", "predicted_answer": "C", "raw_answer": "根据八字命盘分析，命主日主为乙木，生于丑月（冬季末），木气衰弱。年柱丙戌，月柱辛丑，时柱庚辰，天干透出辛金和庚金，金旺克木，日主乙木受克严重，且地支丑土、戌土、辰土均为湿土，土重木折，命局中木气极弱，缺乏生扶。\n\n在婴儿期（一岁前），命主处于大运或流年影响下，此时正值丙戌年（2006年）至丁亥年（2007年）交接，流年丁亥，亥水本可生木，但亥被丑土、戌土所克，水气不显，反而加重土势。命局中金旺克木，木主肝胆、筋骨，但婴儿期常见疾病多与呼吸系统或心脏相关。金旺克木，金主肺，木主肝，金木交战，易有肺或呼吸道问题，但选项中肺炎（C）较为直接对应肺金受克。同时，土重埋金，金气不畅，也可能影响心脏（火被土晦），但心脏有孔（B）在命理中多与火（心）受克或水（肾）不济有关，此处火弱（丙火被丑土晦），但更明显的是金木相战。\n\n综合来看，命局中金旺木衰，金主肺，木主肝，金木相战最易引发呼吸系统疾病，且婴儿期体质娇弱，肺炎（C）是常见且与金气受克相符的病症。其他选项如弱视（与木主目有关，但木衰极，更可能表现为视力问题，但非一岁前典型）、心脏有孔（火弱，但火在年干丙，尚有余气）、地中海贫血（与血相关，属水木，但此处金旺克木，血病不显）。\n\n因此，最符合命理推断的是肺炎。\n\n最终答案：C", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "male_20070131_P008-Q36", 1, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-v4flash-nt-20260805-r2\\dev\\2024_b1a_prime_1_g4\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 6602, "response_id": "ffbdc0c5-872d-4c6f-9300-213bafb30f1c", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 217, "completion_tokens": 438, "total_tokens": 655, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 89}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
{"case_id": "male_20070131_P008-Q37", "domain": "wealth", "question": "此命主的出身贫或富？", "expected_answer": "C", "predicted_answer": "B", "raw_answer": "根据八字命盘分析，日主乙木生于丑月，土旺木弱，需火调候。年柱丙戌，丙火透出为用，但戌为燥土，火有根但被丑土晦火，力量不足。月柱辛丑，七杀透干，克身较重，需印星化杀，但八字中水木印比不显，仅时支辰中藏乙木微根，日主偏弱。财星（土）过旺，且丑戌相刑，财库有损，暗示家庭经济状况一般，虽有丙火食伤生财，但火弱土重，财源不显。时柱庚辰，正官合身，主有约束，但官星坐财，压力大。综合看，命主出身非富贵，但也不至贫寒，属于普通家庭，父母有一定能力但非大富，故为小康之家。\n\n最终答案：B", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 0.5, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "male_20070131_P008-Q37", 1, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-v4flash-nt-20260805-r2\\dev\\2024_b1a_prime_1_g4\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 3090, "response_id": "3bc50d06-192a-4d3d-bf2f-b5f19de0e72f", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 217, "completion_tokens": 204, "total_tokens": 421, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 89}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
